closeOrder
├── Given unauthorized caller, unknown or closed order
│   └── It reverts without accounting changes
├── Given full finite allowance consumption
│   ├── Insufficient BOLD or wrong escrow receipt reverts atomically
│   └── It credits gross BOLD including same-purpose donations exactly once
├── Given untouched allowance
│   ├── Before expiry without Safe cancellation it remains pending
│   └── After expiry or Safe cancellation it refunds original input, excluding donations
├── Given partial spend
│   └── It fails closed instead of inferring a partial fill
└── Given concurrent sources and out-of-order finalization
    └── It conserves every original input independently
